 "review": {
  "management_type_reason": "MBG・種: 地下茎とこぼれ種で攻撃的に広がると明記。NC State・種: 肥えた湿った土では攻撃的で、抑えるため毎年〜2年ごとの株分けが必要。stauden.de も広がりを区切るよう指示。商品は種そのもの",
  "management_type_quote": "Species plants are noted for being aggressive spreaders in the landscape by both rhizomes and self-seeding.",
  "management_type_by_matching": "E 隔離推奨型",
  "heat_west_only": "中",
  "muggy_west_only": null,
  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[MBG/種] Stems tend to flop in rich soils, too much shade or hot summer temperatures.\n[NC State/種] Stems may flop in rich soils, shade, or hot temperatures, so staking of taller plants may be necessary.\n[RHS/品種] Aspect: East-facing or South-facing or West-facing",
  "spread_evidence": "[地下茎 3／NC State・種] It can be aggressive in rich, moist soils ... keep plants contained（読み直し）\n[こぼれ種 3／MBG・種] aggressive spreaders in the landscape by both rhizomes and self-seeding（読み直し）\n[こぼれ種 1／MBG・種] Species plants are noted for being aggressive spreaders in the landscape by both rhizomes and self-seeding.\n[地下茎 3／MBG・種] Species plants can be an aggressive spreader.\n[地下茎の食い違い] stauden.de は 2 相当\n[読み直し 2026-11-24] こぼれ種：言い回しの照合では 1、文を読み直して 3（[MBG・種] aggressive spreaders in the landscape by both rhizomes and self-seeding）\n[増え方] こぼれ種・地下茎の段階に合わせて直した（前：地下茎、ランナー）",
